### Background Removal API Tests
### Using test-token authentication (test-user-12345)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = test-token

### 1. Basic Background Removal (Synchronous)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generation/remove-background
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "image_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/falserverless/model_tests/remove_background/aronj.png",
  "waitForCompletion": true,
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### 2. Background Removal with Cropping
POST {{baseUrl}}/generation/remove-background
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "image_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/falserverless/model_tests/remove_background/aronj.png",
  "crop_to_bbox": true,
  "waitForCompletion": true,
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### 3. Async Background Removal (Returns immediately)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generation/remove-background
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "image_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/falserverless/model_tests/remove_background/aronj.png",
  "waitForCompletion": false
}

### 4. Sync Mode with FAL
POST {{baseUrl}}/generation/remove-background
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "image_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/falserverless/model_tests/remove_background/aronj.png",
  "sync_mode": true,
  "crop_to_bbox": false,
  "waitForCompletion": true,
  "timeoutMs": 30000
}

### 5. Product Image Background Removal
POST {{baseUrl}}/generation/remove-background
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "image_url": "https://example.com/product.jpg",
  "crop_to_bbox": true,
  "waitForCompletion": true
}

### 6. Get Asset Status (Check completion for async)
# Replace {assetId} with the actual asset ID from async response
GET {{baseUrl}}/generation/assets/{assetId}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. List All Background Removal Assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/generation/assets?modelName=fal-ai/imageutils/rembg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get User Credits (Should show deductions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/generation/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
